      "content": "7.1 Kerala Public Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The Kerala Public Service Commission (KPSC) is responsible for recruiting officers to the Kerala Police Department.",
        "Candidates preparing for the Sub Inspector rank must thoroughly understand the designated SI Examination Pattern.",
        "A significant portion of the competitive exam focuses on relevant statutory acts and legal provisions applicable in Kerala.",
        "Understanding the administrative hierarchy of the Police Department is critical for Kerala PSC aspirants."
      ],
      "id": "nzgl4am"
